p; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4. Cetak Krtu Peserta Ujiian Tes PCMB</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/bawah.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p><code class=\"css plain\">&nbsp;</code>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; REGISTRASI&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Upload Berkas Syarat Pendaftaran&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cek Informasi Keluusn&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; KTP, KK, Ijazh dan Photo 3x4</p>\r\n<p><code class=\"css plain\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/kiri.png\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" />&nbsp; <img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/kiri_2.png\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g4_6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</code></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', ''),
(36, 'Sarana Prasarana', '<p><!-- ######## This is a comment  ######## --></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"example2\">Institut Agama Islam ( IAI ) Persis Bandung&nbsp; untuk menunjang proses belajar mahasiswa.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">1. Tanah Hak Milik seluas 12.500 m2</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">2. Gedung Kuliah A, berlantai 2</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">3. Gedung Kuliah B, berlantai 3</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">4. Gedung Kuliah C, berlantai 2</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">5. Ma`ahad (Rusun Mahasiswa)</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">6. Laboratorium Microteaching</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">7. Laboratorium Tahfidz</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">8. Laboratorium Dakwah</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">9. Enterpreneur Home</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">10. Lapangan Olah Raga</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">11. Perpustakaan</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">12. Auditorium</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">13. Masjid</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">14. Kantin</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">15. HOT spot</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">\r\n<ul style=\"background-color: #89bbaa; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 40px;\">16. BMT Berkah Umat</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Semua fasilitas yang ada digunakan untuk menunjang proses belajar mahasiswa.</p>\r\n<p>Segera Joint dengan Kampus IAI Persis Bandung....&nbsp;</p>', ''),
