(50, ' Alur PCMB 2024-2025', '<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/aLUR_pROSES.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Pilih Jalur Pendaftaran</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Silakan mencari jalur pendaftaran yang sedang dibuka. Pendaftar juga bisa memilih jalur pendaftar berdasarkan prodi yang diinginkan</span></p>\r\n<p>1. Masuk Halaman PMB Link&nbsp; Pendaftaran&nbsp; sesuai&nbsp; dengan&nbsp; Perguruan Tinggi. Klik CARI JALUR PENDAFTARAN untuk&nbsp; melihat jalur yang dibuka.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/svm1_3.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. Pilih jalur pendaftaran</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #333399;\">Setelah mendapatkan jalur yang diinginkan, untuk melakukan pendaftaran klik DAFTAR SEKARANG.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/svm1_5.png\" alt=\"\" /><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>INPUT DATA PENDAFTARAN AWAL</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333399;\"><strong>Setelah memilih jalur yang diinginkan, berikut lakukan pengisian data awal</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Pilih Prodi yang diinginkan</strong></p>\r\n<p>Klik pada PILIHAN PROGRAM STUDI, kemudian klik LANJUTKAN MENDAFTAR.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/svm1_6.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Lengkapi daftar pendaftaran</strong></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/svm1_7.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;3. Lakukan pengecekan data, apabila telah selesaiKlik LANJUT MENDAFTAR</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/svm1_8.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>PEMBAYARAN TAGIHAN FORMULIR PENDAFTARAN</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333399;\">Ketika jalur pendaftaran berbayar, maka akan di arahkan untuk memilih metode pembayaran yang akan digunakan, apabila memiliki kode voucer dari Perguruan Tinggi, silahkan bisa di inputkan dan apabila memlih pembyaran dengan Manual atau offline silahkan hub Bagian keuangan melalui WA yang tersedia sudut kanan bawah. dengan memilih menu BAYAR blok biru</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #333399;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/svm1_10.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/svm1_11.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LOGIN HALAMAN PMB</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333399;\">Pendaftar dapat melakukan login meskipun belum membayar Formulir Pendaftaran, namun tidak bisa melanjutkan untuk pengisian Biodata, Ketika pendaftar belum membayar, sistem akan mengarahkan ke menu Tagihan Formulir Pendaftraran, setelah Pendaftar melakukan pembayaran Formulir Pendaftran dan di validasi sama baian keuangn baru bisa akses ketahap pengisina Biodata dan seterusnya</span></p>', ''),
(40, 'Pembayaran', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1. Setelah melakukan pengisian data Lakukan pembayaran uang pendaftran ke Teller BMT atau Transfer Ke&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;CIMB NIAGA SYARIAH&nbsp;(Kode Bank 022) 397920200710001</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">2. Setelah melakukan pembayaran upload struk pembayaran di form Login calon mahasiswa melalui&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; link&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"index.php?pilih=login&amp;modul=yes\" target=\"_blank\">pmb.iaipibandung.ac.id&nbsp;</a></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;FORM LOGIN MAHASISWA</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/FORM_LOGIN_3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">UPLOAD BUKTI PEMBAYARAN</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/Pembayaran.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">3. Setelaaah pembayaran terkonfirmasi, calon mahasiswa bisa cetak buki pendaftaran dan cetak kartu peserta test&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; PCMB</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; BUKTI PENDAFTARAN SETELAH TERKONFIRMASI</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/uktti.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;4. Email konfirmasi ke email calon mahasiswa setelah datanya di validasi panitia PMB</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/konfirmasi.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>', ''),
(39, 'Form PMB', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1.&nbsp;Isi form pendaftaran dengan lengkap dan benar, setelah selesai kilk&nbsp;<a href=\"https://iaipibdg.sevimaplatform.com/spmbfront/\">Daftar&nbsp;</a><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #0000ff;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/Form-PMB_8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"600\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;2. setelah klik DAFTAR muncul Pop UP Pemberitahuan pendaftaran berhasil</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/POP_UP_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">3. klik gabung WhatsApp Grup sebagai sarana untuk komunikasi antara calon mahasiswa dan Panitia PMB</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">4. Kemudian Cetak untuk print out bukti pendaftaran yang berisi informasi mengenai PMB dan informasi untuk&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;login&nbsp;ke web&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"index.php?pilih=login&amp;modul=yes\" target=\"_blank\">pmb.iaipibandung.ac.id</a> </span>( User: ID PMB pass: Tgl Lahir dengan format Tahun-Bualan-Hari )&nbsp;atau Save&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;bukti Pendaftaran dalam bentuk Pdf</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">BUKTI PENDAFTARAN</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/bukti_daftar_2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">5. Cek e-Mail yang berisi informasi sama mengenai PMB</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/e-mail.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', 'Form-PMB.jpg'),
(41, 'GAMBAR', '<p>Membuat Efek Hover Zoom Dengan CSS3 | www.malasngoding.com</p>\r\n<h1>Membuat Efek Zoom Dengan CSS3 | www.malasngoding.com</h1>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.malasngoding.com/zoom-effect-image-css/\">Tutorial Efek Hover Zoom CSS3</a></p>\r\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"zoom-effect\">\r\n<div class=\"kotak\"><img src=\"https://www.malasngoding.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/gambar.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', ''),
(42, 'PENGUMUMAN KELULUSAN', '<p>Informai kelulusan calon mahasiswa biisa di lihat di Status USM</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/LUUS.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>', ''),
(43, 'Upload Berkas', '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;Setelah dinyatakkan lulus calon mahasiswa mengupload berkas persyaratan KTP, KK, ijazah dan foto.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/usm_1.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>', ''),
(44, 'REGISTRASI', '<p>1. Setelah di nyatakan lulus selanjutnya mahasiswa berhak mendapatkan KTM ( Kartu Tabda Maahasiwa )&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;dan NIM&nbsp; ( No Induk mahasiswa )&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2. Setelah mendapatkan NIM mahasiswa bisa melakukan&nbsp;pembayaran registrasi ke BMT atau bisa melalui SISTEM&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Informasi AKADEMIK&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>(<a style=\"color: #339966;\" href=\"siakad.iaipibandung.ac.id\" target=\"_blank\">SIAKAD</a>)</strong></span>&nbsp; User: NIM Password : NIIM</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/sakd.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>', ''),
(45, 'alur2', '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g1_4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/kanan_2.png\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"pages/39/Form-PMB.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g2_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/kanan_4.png\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"pages/40/Pembayaran.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g3_3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a></p>\r\n<p>Klik&nbsp;<strong>pmb.iaipibandung.ac.id</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1. klik&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"index.php?pilih=pmb&amp;modul=yes\" target=\"_blank\">Daftar</a></strong></span>, isi form dengan lengkap&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bayar Pendaftaran&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; melalui HP Android/PC&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. Gabug Grup WA PCMB&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1. Transfer ke CIMB NIAGA SYARIAH&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3. Cetak Bukti Pendaftaran&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (Kode Bank 022) 397920200710001&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4. Cek e-Mail&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. Teller BMT BMT&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (Kampus IAIPI Jl.Ciganitri No.2&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cipagalo Buahbatu Bandung)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4. Cetak Krtu Peserta Ujiian Tes PCMB</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/bawah.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p><code class=\"css plain\">&nbsp;</code>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; REGISTRASI&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Upload Berkas Syarat Pendaftaran&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cek Informasi Keluusn&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; KTP, KK, Ijazh dan Photo 3x4</p>\r\n<p><code class=\"css plain\">&nbsp;<a href=\"pages/44/REGISTRASI.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/kiri.png\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"pages/43/Upload-Berkas.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/kiri_2.png\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"pages/42/PENGUMUMAN-KELULUSAN.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/g4_6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</code></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><code class=\"css plain\">DOWNLOAD ALUS PENDAFTARAN</code></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', ''),
(46, 'Tata Cara Daftar Online', '<p>1. Kunjungi laman&nbsp;<a href=\"pmb.iaipibandung.ac.id\" target=\"_blank\">pmb.iaipibandung.ac.id</a></p>\r\n<p>2. Pilih menu daftar</p>\r\n<p>3. isi form pendaftaran dengan lengkap dan benar</p>\r\n<p>4. Setelah selesai pengisian form klik daftar</p>\r\n<p>5. setelah klik daftar akan muncul Pop Up atau pesan pendaftaran anda berhasil, kemudian ada perintah gabung&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;WhatsUp grup cetak Bukti pendaftaran dan cek e-mail</p>\r\n<p>6. Bukti pendaftaran berisi informasi mengenai user dan password login ke web pmb berikut tanggal tanggal Tes dll.</p>\r\n<p>7. Selanjutnya anda di haruskan membayar uang pendaftran ke BMT atau bisa di transfer ke bank&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;CIMB NIAGA SYARIAH.</p>\r\n<p>8. Setelah melakukan pembayaran upload bukti pembayaran di menu Pembayaran dengan login terlebih dahulu di&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (pmb.iaipibandung.ac.id ) menggunakan password yang tercantum di bukti pembayaran</p>\r\n<p>9. selanjutnya mahasiswa bisa cetak kartu peserta Tes PCMB yang wajib dibawa pada waktu pelaksanaanya.</p>\r\n<p>10. Pengumuman kelulusan bisa di lihat dengan login terlebih dahulu di link pmb, dan bisa di lihat di menu Status USM.</p>\r\n<p>11. Setelah dinyatakan lulus mahasiswa diharuskan mengupload berkas KK,KTP, Ijazah dan poto di link pmb&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>12. selanjutnya mahasiswa melakukan Registrasi untuk mendapatkan KTM dan NIM.</p>', ''),
(47, 'prodi', '<section id=\"popular-courses\" class=\"courses\">\r\n<div class=\"container mt-5 aos-init aos-animate\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n<div class=\"section-title\">\r\n<h5 class=\"title\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Informasi Program Studi STKINDO Wirautama</span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row aos-init aos-animate\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\" data-aos-delay=\"100\">\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><button class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #8ea2fb;\" type=\"button\"> 1.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://stkindowirautama.ac.id/\">Kesehatan Masyarakat (S1)</a> </button></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><!-- En\r\n<!-- End Course Item--></span>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><button class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #8ea2fb;\" type=\"button\"> 2.&nbsp; <a class=\"text-light\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/3/Kebidanan%20%28S1%29\">Keperawatan (S1)</a> </button></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><!-- End Course Item--></span>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><button class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #8ea2fb;\" type=\"button\">6.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/5/Ilmu%20Keperawatan%20%28S1%29\">Ners Keperawatan</a> </button></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><!-- End Course Item--></span>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><button class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #8ea2fb;\" type=\"button\"> 3.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/6/Profesi%20Ners\">Kebidanan (S1)</a> </button></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br /><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><!-- End Course Item--></span>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><button class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #8ea2fb;\" type=\"button\"> 7.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/6/Profesi%20Ners\">Profesi Kebidanan</a> </button></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><button class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #8ea2fb;\" type=\"button\"> 4.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/7/Pendidikan%20Profesi%20Bidan\">4. Kebidanan (D3)</a> </button></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- End Course Item--></section>', '');
INSERT INTO `halaman` (`id`, `judul`, `konten`, `foto`) VALUES
(48, 'rwerewrw', '<div class=\"container mt-5 aos-init aos-animate\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\r\n<div class=\"section-title\">\r\n<h5 class=\"title\">Informasi Program Studi STKINDO Wirautama</h5>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"row aos-init aos-animate\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\" data-aos-delay=\"100\">\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\"> 1.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" href=\"https://stkindowirautama.ac.id/\">Kesehatan Masyarakat (S1)</a> </button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><!-- En\r\n<!-- End Course Item--></p>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\"> 2.&nbsp; <a class=\"text-light\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/3/Kebidanan%20%28S1%29\">Keperawatan (S1)</a> </button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><!-- End Course Item--></p>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">6.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/5/Ilmu%20Keperawatan%20%28S1%29\">Ners Keperawatan</a> </button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><!-- End Course Item--></p>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\"> 3.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/6/Profesi%20Ners\">Kebidanan (S1)</a> </button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><br /><!-- End Course Item--></p>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\"> 7.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/6/Profesi%20Ners\">Profesi Kebidanan</a> </button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"course-item\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"course-content\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"trainer-profile d-flex align-items-center\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\"> 4.&nbsp;<a class=\"text-light\" href=\"https://stikesmedistra-indonesia.ac.id/Akademik/Program-Studi/7/Pendidikan%20Profesi%20Bidan\">4. Kebidanan (D3)</a> </button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', ''),
(49, 'Membuat Akun SISTER versi Cloud', '<p>Berikut cara registrasi akun di SISTER (versi Cloud):</p>\r\n<p>1. Masuk ke URL berikut&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sister.kemdikbud.go.id/\">https://sister.kemdikbud.go.id</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. Kemudian pada Beranda, klik tombol &ldquo;<strong>Belum punya akun? Daftar Sekarang</strong>&rdquo;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/login_1.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>', ''),
(51, 'Alur Pendaftaran', '<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/alur-pendaftaran-small_1_4.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>', ''),
(52, 'BROSUR', '<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Program Sarjana ( S1 )</strong></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/G3_BROSUR.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/G3_BROSUR2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Program Magister ( S2 )</strong></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/G4_BROSUR1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"js/tinymce/plugins/image/uploads/G4_BROSUR2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></p>', ''),
(53, 'Jadwal Pendaftaran dan Seleksi', '<p><strong>Jadwal Pendaftaran Program Sarjana (S1)</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://iaipibandung.ac.id/pages/145/visi-misi-iai.html\">âœ…</a>&nbsp;Gelombang 1&nbsp; <strong>:</strong> 01 Desember 2024 sd 13 Juni 2025<br /><span class=\"x19la9d6 x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x19co3pv x1g5zs5t xfibh0p xiy17q3 x1xsqp64 x1lkfr7t xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd\"><span class=\"xrtxmta x1bhl96m\">âœï¸</span></span>&nbsp;Tes Seleksi&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;:</strong> 14 Juni 2025.<br /><a href=\"https://iaipibandung.ac.id/pages/145/visi-misi-iai.html\">âœ…</a>&nbsp;Gelombang 2 <strong>:</strong> 15 Juni 2024 sd 18 Juli 2025<br /><span class=\"x19la9d6 x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x19co3pv x1g5zs5t xfibh0p xiy17q3 x1xsqp64 x1lkfr7t xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd\"><span class=\"xrtxmta x1bhl96m\">âœï¸</span></span>&nbsp;Tes Seleksi&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>:</strong> 19 Juni 2025.<br /><a href=\"https://iaipibandung.ac.id/pages/145/visi-misi-iai.html\">âœ…</a>&nbsp;Gelombang 3<strong> :</strong> 20 Juli 2024 sd 16 Agustus 2025.<br /><span class=\"x19la9d6 x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x19co3pv x1g5zs5t xfibh0p xiy17q3 x1xsqp64 x1lkfr7t xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd\"><span class=\"xrtxmta x1bhl96m\">âœï¸</span></span>&nbsp;Tes Seleksi&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;:</strong> 14 Juni 2025.<br /><a href=\"https://iaipibandung.ac.id/pages/145/visi-misi-iai.html\">âœ…</a>&nbsp;Pengumuman Hasil Seleksi <strong>:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Jadwal Pendaftaran Program Magister (S2)</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://iaipibandung.ac.id/pages/145/visi-misi-iai.html\">âœ…</a>&nbsp;01 Desember 2024 sd 30 Setember 2025<br /><span class=\"x19la9d6 x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x19co3pv x1g5zs5t xfibh0p xiy17q3 x1xsqp64 x1lkfr7t xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd\"><span class=\"xrtxmta x1bhl96m\">âœï¸</span></span>&nbsp;Tes Seleksi&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: 14 Juni 2025.<br /><a href=\"https://iaipibandung.ac.id/pages/145/visi-misi-iai.html\">âœ…</a>&nbsp;Pengumuman Hasil Seleksi<strong>:</strong></p>', ''),
